# hypernix.upload

Push artifacts to HuggingFace Hub with multipart + model card generation.

## Documentation pages

No dedicated guide has been published for this subsystem yet. See the API reference and source module.

## API reference

[Open the API reference source](pages/api-reference.mdxl)

### `upload_gguf(files, repo_id='ray0rf1re/HyperNix.1-gguf', token=None, commit_message='Add HyperNix GGUF quantizations', private=False, create_if_missing=True) -> str`

Upload one or more GGUF files to a HuggingFace model repo.

